docs/WORKFLOW.md:220:Both baseline migrations are CLOSED / PASS per the owner. State Request implementation and focused offline validation are authorized; prior baseline-only/feature-deferral language is historical for this task. Preserve owner changes and all Stage 5 controls. No live database, credentials, real audit/approval/authorization records, paid provisioning, or Git staging/commit/push are authorized.
